Objective: Defend colony against alien attack and obtain eco rating of 100

Planet: Sanctuary
Clan: Ayer's Hand

Notes: You have colonized Sanctuary according to all the regulations, but your sponsor has decided that he can exploit it better robotically rather than by collecting rents from you. He has hired one of the few remaining M.A.X. Commanders of Concord origin to use Concord equipment to take it away from you. If you can defeat this outlaw attack, the Concord will reprimand their member and ensure that this will not happen again.

You have 3 Eco-spheres, 3 Training halls, and 3 R&D labs but only one Habitat. If you can defend and operate the 3 eco-spheres it looks like you should catch up and surpass your opponent in eco rating. But it is almost certain that you need infiltrators to deal with the alien fighting units closing in on your complex. Can you affort to shut down the eco-spheres to train infiltrators?

